[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3 uid="uid://unitglowagx"]

; Glow under the AgX tone curve rather than FILMIC. Every other glow fixture uses the editor
; preview's FILMIC. AgX diverges most (a rec2020 inset, a piecewise sigmoid about middle grey,
; an outset), and its hard toe crushes the dim halo tail glow produces, so a curve applied in
; the wrong place shows here.

